  "notes": "{務|つと}める means to fulfill a role or duty.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: 〜を{務|つと}める (to serve as ~)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {司会|しかい}を{務|つと}める: to serve as MC\n- {役|やく}を{務|つと}める: to play a role\n- {委員長|いいんちょう}を{務|つと}める: to serve as chair\n- {責任者|せきにんしゃ}を{務|つと}める: to serve as the person in charge\n\nSIMILAR WORDS (same reading, different kanji):\n- {務|つと}める: to serve as, to fill a role\n- {勤|つと}める: to work at, to be employed\n- {努|つと}める: to make an effort",
